{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-book-catalog.md","title":"Book-72 catalog structure","display":"df-book-catalog — Book-72 catalog structure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-book-catalog","aliases":["72-df-book-catalog"],"display":"df-book-catalog — Book-72 catalog structure","depends_on":["[[72-df-entry-index]]","[[72-df-chapter-catalog]]","[[72-df-symbol-index]]"],"source_kind":"local-finite-index","verification_status":"finite-registry-and-links-checked; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-book-catalog"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-book-catalog</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-book-catalog — Book-72 catalog structure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"70ff58eeae2491db\" href=\"?note=70ff58eeae2491db\" title=\"72-df-entry-index\">72-df-entry-index</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"00439897fba390aa\" href=\"?note=00439897fba390aa\" title=\"72-df-chapter-catalog\">72-df-chapter-catalog</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2e1cc33090ad6f68\" href=\"?note=2e1cc33090ad6f68\" title=\"72-df-symbol-index\">72-df-symbol-index</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"local-finite-index"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"finite-registry-and-links-checked; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>元理论为ZFC；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb S:=\\{0,\\ldots,127\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbb S:=\\{0,\\ldots,127\\}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 是ASCII有限字符串集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\mathtt{s}\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\mathtt{s}\\urcorner\\)</span> 表示显示ASCII字面串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 的字符编码序列，不是文件的数学内容。文件标识省略扩展名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\".md\">\\(.md\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{df},\\mathsf{thm},\\mathsf{cor},\\mathsf{lem}\">\\(\\mathsf{df},\\mathsf{thm},\\mathsf{cor},\\mathsf{lem}\\)</span> 是互异类型标签。</li>\n<li>下式有限枚举是本文件的完整输入数据；没有从Remark、目录路径或外部文件系统读取未声明的集合。它登记合并修订后72的文件标识，字符串包含本文件自身标识不构成数学递归。</li>\n<li>文件与类型函数取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"70ff58eeae2491db\" href=\"?note=70ff58eeae2491db\" title=\"72-df-entry-index\">72-df-entry-index</a>；章节关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"00439897fba390aa\" href=\"?note=00439897fba390aa\" title=\"72-df-chapter-catalog\">72-df-chapter-catalog</a>；符号关系取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e1cc33090ad6f68\" href=\"?note=2e1cc33090ad6f68\" title=\"72-df-symbol-index\">72-df-symbol-index</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in\\mathbb S\">\\(s\\in\\mathbb S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> 为类型标签，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,10\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,10\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{72}&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Files}_{72},\\operatorname{Kind}_{72},\\operatorname{ChapterIndex}_{72},\\mathcal G_{72}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CatalogFile}(s)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow s\\in\\operatorname{Files}_{72},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CatalogEntry}(s,t,J)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow s\\in\\operatorname{Files}_{72}\\land t=\\operatorname{Kind}_{72}(s)\\land J=\\operatorname{Chapters}_{72}(s).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_{72}&amp;:=\\langle\\operatorname{Files}_{72},\\operatorname{Kind}_{72},\\operatorname{ChapterIndex}_{72},\\mathcal G_{72}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{CatalogFile}(s)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow s\\in\\operatorname{Files}_{72},\\\\\n\\operatorname{CatalogEntry}(s,t,J)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow s\\in\\operatorname{Files}_{72}\\land t=\\operatorname{Kind}_{72}(s)\\land J=\\operatorname{Chapters}_{72}(s).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>以下为原包历史导航说明及同步后的阅读链接；历史数量与历史核验状态不作为本次修订统计。它们不是前两节定义的附加条件。</p>\n<h3 id=\"Handbook-of-Proof-Theory-—-总导航\">Handbook of Proof Theory — 总导航</h3>\n<p>Samuel R. Buss 主编，Elsevier，1998，Studies in Logic and the Foundations of Mathematics 137。PDF为一基页号。主题分组用于导航；补充来源与本地推导由各原子明确标记，不能把它们误称为原书编号定理。</p>\n<div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">数量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>corollary</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>definition</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">228</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lemma</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">19</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>proposition</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>theorem</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">71</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原子合计</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">322</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导航/术语文件</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"表格\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>原书标题</th>\n<th>作者</th>\n<th>印刷页</th>\n<th>PDF页</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">主题条目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>I</td>\n<td>An Introduction to Proof Theory</td>\n<td>Samuel R. Buss</td>\n<td>1–78</td>\n<td>13–90</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">91</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>II</td>\n<td>First-Order Proof Theory of Arithmetic</td>\n<td>Samuel R. Buss</td>\n<td>79–148</td>\n<td>91–160</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">26</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>III</td>\n<td>Hierarchies of Provably Recursive Functions</td>\n<td>Matt Fairtlough; Stanley S. Wainer</td>\n<td>149–208</td>\n<td>161–220</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">25</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IV</td>\n<td>Subsystems of Set Theory and Second Order Number Theory</td>\n<td>Wolfram Pohlers</td>\n<td>209–336</td>\n<td>221–348</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">58</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>V</td>\n<td>Gödel’s Functional (Dialectica) Interpretation</td>\n<td>Jeremy Avigad; Solomon Feferman</td>\n<td>337–406</td>\n<td>349–418</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VI</td>\n<td>Realizability</td>\n<td>A. S. Troelstra</td>\n<td>407–474</td>\n<td>419–486</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">11</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VII</td>\n<td>The Logic of Provability</td>\n<td>Giorgi Japaridze; Dick de Jongh</td>\n<td>475–546</td>\n<td>487–558</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">12</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VIII</td>\n<td>The Lengths of Proofs</td>\n<td>Pavel Pudlák</td>\n<td>547–638</td>\n<td>559–650</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">29</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IX</td>\n<td>A Proof-Theoretic Framework for Logic Programming</td>\n<td>Gerhard Jäger; Robert F. Stärk</td>\n<td>639–682</td>\n<td>651–694</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">15</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>X</td>\n<td>Types in Logic, Mathematics and Programming</td>\n<td>Robert L. Constable</td>\n<td>683–786</td>\n<td>695–798</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">40</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>原包上一轮以296个原子为基线，新增26个（第III章9、第V章9、第VIII章8），修订17个既有原子，并同步5个导航/术语文件。新增内容包括结构化树序数与增长层次、System T全类型语义与等式矩阵见证、Tseitin编码与扩展归结。修订覆盖ω接口来源、二阶算术语法闭合及现有增长层次说明。陈述核对、本地证明、来源证明与未验证部分分别记录；所有既有eligible_as_verified_dependency=false限制均保留。原包上一轮没有逐一重验其余全部既有原子的证明。</p>\n<p>前次历史：从266个原子增至296个，新增30个（VI章7、VII章7、IX章8、X章8），修订7个既有原子；更早记录包含237个原子的复核。此段仅保存前次工作历史，不计为原包上一轮成果。</p>\n<p>主题位置已校正：通用证明树归I章，ω接口归III章，序数分析及Pohlers补充接口归IV章；PA加ω规则的本地标准模型可靠性归II章。主题归属不表示来源一定是该章原书。</p>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"70ff58eeae2491db\" href=\"?note=70ff58eeae2491db\" title=\"72-df-entry-index\">逐项索引</a> · <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2e1cc33090ad6f68\" href=\"?note=2e1cc33090ad6f68\" title=\"72-df-symbol-index\">符号接口</a> · <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"00439897fba390aa\" href=\"?note=00439897fba390aa\" title=\"72-df-chapter-catalog\">十章主题导航</a></p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Handbook-of-Proof-Theory-—-总导航","text":"Handbook of Proof Theory — 总导航","level":3}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-entry-index","status":"resolved","id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-entry-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-chapter-catalog","status":"resolved","id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-chapter-catalog]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-symbol-index","status":"resolved","id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-symbol-index]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-entry-index","status":"resolved","id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"文件与类型函数取 [[72-df-entry-index]]；章节关系取 [[72-df-chapter-catalog]]；符号关系取 [[72-df-symbol-index]]。$s\\in\\mathbb S$，$t$ 为类型标签，$J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,10\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-chapter-catalog","status":"resolved","id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"文件与类型函数取 [[72-df-entry-index]]；章节关系取 [[72-df-chapter-catalog]]；符号关系取 [[72-df-symbol-index]]。$s\\in\\mathbb S$，$t$ 为类型标签，$J\\subseteq\\{1,\\ldots,10\\}$。","embed":fals